# The last matching line wins, so the general rules come first and the exemption last.

* text=auto
*.cs text diff=csharp
*.axaml text
*.csproj text
*.props text
*.targets text
*.md text
*.json text
*.yml text

# Golden fixtures are compared byte for byte. End-of-line conversion would rewrite exactly
# the property they exist to test -- a CRLF fixture checked out with line feeds still passes
# every round-trip test while proving nothing -- so it is switched off for them entirely.
# FixtureIntegrityTests fails if this ever stops working.
tests/**/Fixtures/** -text
